<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50473" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμερό-εις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵμερος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exciting desire, lovely,
				charming</i>, in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> always of things, 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμερόεντα . . ἔργα γάμοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.429
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χροὸς ἱμερόεντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					14.170
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀοιδή, ἔπεα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.421
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				17.519
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόος</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵμερος</span>) <i><span class="en">
				10.398
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χαρίτων χορὸν ἱμερόεντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.194
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				18.603
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμερόεν κιθάριζε</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				570
			</span></i>; so later 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κισσός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.P.
					947
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρωτες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.277
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>); of persons, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				87
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				1365
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				7.118
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύμφη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Coluth.
					295
				</span></i>
			.</div>
